t","description":"Repairs cloudstone cable within shielded forge-pits.","category":"physical"}]},{"id":"chr_sefa_lindqvist","name":"Sefa Lindqvist","role":"supporting","description":"A bright-eyed cartographer from Silverspine Academy, thirty, with ink-stained fingers, round spectacles, and a satchel overflowing with charts. She joins the caravan to map the shifting bridges.","home_location_id":"loc_silverspine","faction_id":"fac_bridge_wardens","motivation":"To chart the changing skybridge network accurately before war redraws it forever.","goal":"Complete a true map of the caravan's route and publish it at Silverspine Academy.","flaw":"She is naive about danger and trusts maps over the people who live by them.","internal_conflict":"Her scholarly neutrality clashes with her growing loyalty to the caravan crew.","external_conflict":"Both the Cartel and the Wardens want her maps, and each wants to control what the maps reveal.","arc":"Starts as a detached scholar who sees the war as data. When Ilvane demands her charts to trap the caravan, she chooses to hide the true route and give a false map, ending as an invested guide who uses knowledge to protect people.","personality_traits":["curious","earnest","absent-minded"],"abilities":[{"name":"Skybridge cartography","description":"Charts drifting bridges and predicts their shifts.","category":"mental"}]}],"relationships":[{"id":"rel_marisol_tobin_mentor","source_character_id":"chr_marisol_vane","target_character_id":"chr_tobin_reck","relationship_type":"mentor","description":"Marisol Vane mentors Tobin Reck as a surrogate parent, but her trust is tested when his secret Cartel reporting is exposed."},{"id":"rel_ilvane_marisol_enemy","source_character_id":"chr_ilvane_dross","target_character_id":"chr_marisol_vane","relationship_type":"enemy","description":"Ilvane Dross uses the Grain Levy to pressure Marisol Vane into Cartel service, driving the caravan's central conflict."},{"id":"rel_ilvane_tobin_handler","source_charac